{"product_id":"the-murder-book","title":"The Murder Book","description":"\u003cp\u003eTom Thorne finally has it all.In Nicola Tanner and Phil Hendricks, Thorne has good friends by his side. His love life is newly reformed by a promising relationship and he is happy in the job he has devoted his life to.As he sets off hunting the woman responsible for a series of grisly murders, Thorne has no way of knowing that he will be plunged into a nightmare from which he may never wake. A nightmare that has a name. Thorne’s past threatens to catch up with him and a ruinous secret is about to be revealed. If he wants to save himself and his friends, he will have to do the unthinkable.Tom Thorne finally has a lot to lose.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 124 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mark Billingham\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780751577303\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 400\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738310238361,"sku":"14RC9780751577303","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca9fbd65fa1_The_Murder_Book_Mark_Billingham.jpg?v=1758563459","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-murder-book","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}